XavensLeaves:
CHECK_ALIVE Xavens
BEQ 0x1 0xc 0x0
CAM1 Xavens
FlashCursor(Xavens,30)
Text(FillerDialogue)
STAL 10
CAM1 Xavens
WARPOUT [7,15]
SilentKillUnit(Xavens)
ENDWARP
LABEL 0x1
CHECK_ALIVE Astoria
BEQ 0x4 0xc 0x0
CAM1 Astoria
FlashCursor(Astoria,30)
