ENDWARP
EndEvent

EndingScene:
SET_ACTIVE 0
MUSC 0x0
CleanTextNoMap(0x18,FillerDialogue)
SilentKillUnit(Benthus)
MoveToChapter(Stratum2F1)
ENDA


